/*
 * Generated by `drizzle-kit pull` from a disposable PostgreSQL 17 instance with
 * every committed migration applied, then adapted: temporal columns use date
 * mode so they carry Date values; bytea columns are typed explicitly because
 * drizzle-kit cannot introspect them; and every updatedAt column is stamped
 * client-side, because Prisma enforced @updatedAt in its client rather than as
 * a database default - without that, every insert fails a NOT NULL constraint.
 *
 * Schema changes stay hand-written SQL under prisma/migrations - that history is
 * what every deployed installation has applied and what migrations.test.ts
 * asserts on. Regenerate this file from the database after adding a migration;
 * do not hand-edit it.
 */

